OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's Welsh family
OL,4,Aconnection revisited after country
OL,5,Asinger's death
OL,6,
OL,7,FResearcher Elysia Garner said that
OL,8,F"curiosity got the better of the team
OL,9,Fand using publicly available
OL,10,Finformation, we were able to put
OL,11,Ftogether a family tree", leading them
OL,12,Fto discover Parton's eighth
OL,13,Fgreat-grandfather, William Owen Jr, was
OL,14,Fborn in Machynlleth in 1584.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
